   }
   ```
2. **Dependency Injection**: 
   The `PetController` injects the `PetTypeRepository types` dependency to fetch the collection of pet types via its `findPetTypes()` method.

3. **Data Binding**: 
   The `@ModelAttribute("types")` annotation automatically exposes the returned `Collection<PetType>` under the model attribute name `"types"` for any request handled by the controller (such as the pet creation form initialization mapped to `GET /pets/new`). This makes the collection available to the view template for rendering the select dropdown.

